# Packaged indicator zips are built from MQL5/Indicators/HMI/ on demand and
# sent to the user directly; the source in the tree is the record, not the
# binary. Keeping them out avoids one opaque blob per shipped version.
HMI_v*.zip

# MT5 artefacts, if a compiled build ever lands in the tree
*.ex5

